<title>USA: E.W. Scripps May revenues rise 10.6 pct.</title>
<headline>E.W. Scripps May revenues rise 10.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>E.W. Scripps Co said Monday that consolidated revenues rose 10.6 percent in May to $105.5 million, compared to $95.4 million in May 1996.</p>
<p>Newspaper advertising revenues were $45.1 million, up eight percent, and total newspaper revenues rose 8.4 percent to $61.5 million.</p>
<p>Revenues from the television station group increased 1.8 percent to $30.7 million.</p>
<p>Revenues in the entertainment division rose 57 percent to $13.2 million from $8.4 million last year, the company said.</p>
</text>
